OL,4,CCOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal 
OL,5,Cas EU and others reject draft over     
OL,6,Cfossil fuels row                       
OL,7,GThe COP31 climate talks in Turkey have 
OL,8,Gfailed to agree a deal after the EU    
OL,9,Gformally rejected the latest draft     
OL,10,Gagreement -.                           
OL,12,FThe summit's president says the deal   
OL,13,Fhas not been approved, represents an   
OL,14,Falmost unprecedented development.      
OL,16,FAn EU representative has accused some  
OL,17,Foil states of hijacking talks after    
OL,18,Fthe bloc had been pushing to restore a 
OL,19,Fcommitment to move away from fossil    
OL,20,Ffuels - the fourth draft still         
OL,21,Fcontains no mention of fossil fuels.   
OL,22,                                   G1/3 
