OL,3,T///,/,-.,./,,-,-,-.-.,-.,/-.-.,.,.,,///
OL,4,CCOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal 
OL,5,Cas EU and others reject draft over     
OL,6,Cfossil fuels row                       
OL,7,FRussia defend opposing its inclusion - 
OL,8,Fafter producers led by Saudi Arabia    
OL,9,Fhad called for its removal - and was   
OL,10,Fdirectly critical of the EU in its     
OL,11,Fspeech.                                
OL,13,FThe latest draft acknowledges the goal 
OL,14,Fset by the 2015 Paris Agreement of     
OL,15,Fkeeping the rise in global             
OL,16,Ftemperatures below 1.5C is going to be 
OL,17,Fmissed - as warming goes beyond this   
OL,18,Fthe effects of climate change will     
OL,19,Framp up significantly.                 
OL,22,                                   G2/3 
