OL,4,CCOP31 climate talks fail to agree deal 
OL,5,Cas EU and others reject draft over     
OL,6,Cfossil fuels row                       
OL,7,FThe summit is now the longest-running  
OL,8,Fin history, with negotiations          
OL,9,Fcontinuing two days after it had been  
OL,10,Fdue to end - here's a timeline of how  
OL,11,Fwe got here.                           
OL,13,FShould countries be unable to reach    
OL,14,Fconsensus, negotiations could be       
OL,15,Fsuspended until next year, which has   
OL,16,Fhappened only once before at a COP     
OL,17,Fsummit.                                
OL,22,                                   G3/3 
