OL,5,GUK Weather Forecast                    
OL,7,GToday:FMostly dry, breezy and rather   
OL,8,Fcold with sunny spells, especially in  
OL,9,Fthe north and east. A few wintry       
OL,10,Fshowers affect eastern coasts and      
OL,11,Fhills. Windy in the southwest, with    
OL,12,Fheavy rain in places and possible      
OL,13,Fcoastal gales.                         
OL,15,GTonight:FClear spells in the north and 
OL,16,Feast with a frost developing. Rain     
OL,17,Facross the southwest, heavy at times,  
OL,18,Fgradually easing and becoming patchier 
OL,19,Fthrough the night.                     
OL,23,D]C        From the Met Office          
