OL,4,CTheresa May 'aghast' at Burnham's EU   
OL,5,Cplans and says 'Brexit is done'        
OL,6,GFormer Prime Minister Theresa May has  
OL,7,Gwarned Andy Burnham he should "move    
OL,8,Gon" from Brexit, telling the BBC she   
OL,9,Gis "aghast" the prime minister could   
OL,10,Gbe considering rejoining the EU.       
OL,12,FAt the Brussels summit this week the   
OL,13,FPM said he wanted to "brainstorm"      
OL,14,Foptions for the future relationship    
OL,15,Fbetween Britain and the trading bloc.  
OL,17,FIn an exclusive interview with the     
OL,18,FBBC's Sunday with Laura Kuenssberg,    
OL,19,FBaroness May, who spent three years    
OL,20,Fnegotiating an EU exit deal, said:     
OL,21,F"Brexit is done. Just accept Brexit    
OL,22,Fand move on."                          
OL,23,D]CParliament and politics digest...G144
