OL,4,CThree killed and dozens missing after  
OL,5,Cfire at Indonesian factory             
OL,6,GAt least three people have been killed 
OL,7,Gand 36 are still missing after a fire  
OL,8,Gat a confectionary factory in western  
OL,9,GJava on Saturday.                      
OL,11,FFirefighters were still tackling some  
OL,12,Fflames on Sunday, while rescuers       
OL,13,Fsearched for the missing in parts of   
OL,14,Fthe damaged building where workers     
OL,15,Fwere believed to be trapped.           
OL,17,FIndonesia's National Search and Rescue 
OL,18,FAgency said on Sunday 15 survivors had 
OL,19,Fbeen located, and four others taken to 
OL,20,Fhospital and a local clinic with       
OL,21,Fundisclosed injuries.                  
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
